{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-f75e28f31f068651a5893f0087f1d94102ef33cd4e9102b4","family_id":"KR:007467","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Rules on Measurement of Ship Tonnage","title_original":"선박톤수의 측정에 관한 규칙","kind":"해양수산부령","source_version":"233591","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=233591","source_sha256":"86d0a65be806f7367d84c8e503c399209a614e2ef6ffb877cf8a6bbdcaf5f140","body_sha256":"4be2d59f59731be1803b42041b40540c71041d25291137e6b3bcd0e7e0d37c46","article_count":1,"full_text":"Article 35 (Calculation of Gross Tonnage)\nGross tonnage shall be the value obtained by multiplying the international gross tonnage under Article 9 by the coefficient calculated by the following formula, expressed in measurement tons:\n\n(0.6 + t/10,000) × (1 + (30 − t)/180)\n\nt: International gross tonnage calculated under Article 9.\n\nWhere the value of (0.6 + t/10,000) is 1 or greater, that value shall be taken as 1.\nWhere the value of (1 + (30 − t)/180) is less than 1, that value shall be taken as 1.\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_title_record":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.title.json","sha256":"c897b8af8593e31fdc2f6cb0caef7bbf94c13d2953aacc9e1b32bc312a7cd2e9"},"author_unit_artifacts":[{"json":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1522_KR000068\\translations\\tonnage_rule\\en.units.parts\\article-35.json","sha256":"306989a99c7626fdc15614a9ded8d31377ac1e4f0942ca83412f55b8b17cd4c9"},"selfcheck":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\